cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: Anxolotl pipeline
abstract: >-
  Machine learning pipeline for stress/anxiety detection from wearable
  physiological signals, evaluated within-dataset (WESAD, WDD, Anxolotl) and
  cross-dataset (train on WESAD/WDD, test on Anxolotl) using classical models,
  deep learning, ensembles and AutoML, with LOSO cross-validation and
  SHAP-based explainability.
authors:
